al week of the regular season. Here are the best plays, moments and CFP implications.","published":"2026-11-27T14:00:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50596213/rivalry-week-live-cfp-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-27T12:39:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Inside the Pac-12's flex schedule decision to boost Boise State","description":"A look at how the Pac-12 ironed out its first flex week football schedule.","published":"2026-11-27T12:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592934/pac-12-flex-schedule-boise-state-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What rivalries have the biggest stakes? Connelly looks at the end of the season","description":"Among 20 big games, some classic rivalries have fallen down the pecking order.","published":"2026-11-27T12:25:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595179/connelly-rivalry-week-stakes-preview","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Best friends Pat Surtain II, Jaylen Waddle ecstatic about reuniting with Broncos","description":"Surtain and Waddle bonded immediately at Alabama six years ago and have embraced the chance to play together again in Denver on a team with Super Bowl hopes.","published":"2026-11-27T11:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595313/pat-surtain-ii-jaylen-waddle-broncos-alabama-best-friends","type":"Story","byline":"Jeff Legwold","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top DE D.J. Jacobs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4899483/sammy-omosigho","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sammy Omosigho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho","description":"American football linebacker (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:11Z","intro":"Samuel Omosigho (born September 17, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the UCLA Bruins. He previously played for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Omosigho attended Crandall High School in Crandall, Texas. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a four-star recruit, where he held offers from Florida, TCU, and Oklahoma. Ultimately, Omosigho committed to play college football for the Oklahoma Sooners."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first collegiate season at the University of Oklahoma in 2023, Omosigho played in 10 games, notching seven tackles with half a tackle for a loss. During the 2024 season, Omosigho played all 13 games, recording 39 tackles with five being for a loss, six pressures, a pass deflection, and a forced fumble.\nHeading into the 2025 season, he was named to the Butkus Award watch list and earned a starting spot at linebacker for the Sooners. In week one of the 2025 season, Omosigho totaled eight tackles and his first career sack in a season opening win over Illinois State. In week 12, he recorded six tackles and a fumble recovery in an upset win over Alabama.\nIn 2026, Omosigho transferred to the University of California, Los Angeles, to play for the Bruins. He was a first-team midseason All-American selection by the Associated Press and was named a semifinalist for the Butkus Award."}]}}